00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:33,230
we test for mistletoe, wherever we go,

00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:37,870
on a regular basis or that's something you'll have to ask for.

00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:41,470
So remember, when you do your cheek swab testing,

00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:46,670
you fill out that form, but you ask for whatever you want me to test you for.

00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:49,070
